  ('Receive high up, double one-two', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 128, 128, 'Simeone Practice 8', 'Simeone (Atletico Madrid)', 'Game timing in the Y shape with wide and forward support in a micro-game.', 'Double triangle / Y shape: A queue at the bottom, B at a central cone 10 yards up, C top right and D top left forming a 12 yard triangle.', 'B drops, one-two with A, A plays long diagonal to C. C passes across to D, moves in to get it back and then plays an angled pass into D''s run round his cone; D dribbles to the start.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '7-9 (2-4 extra)', 7, 9, '10 yard line / 12 yard triangle', 9.1, 11.0, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 600),
