  ('Complex checking-away sequence in Y shape', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 130, 130, 'Simeone Practice 10', 'Simeone (Atletico Madrid)', 'Support from the third man and from the passer (give-and-go) in one micro-game sequence.', 'Double triangle / Y shape: A queue at the bottom, B at a central cone 10 yards up, C top right and D top left forming a 12 yard triangle.', 'A plays a one-two with B and passes to C. C sets back for B, then runs round his cone and B plays into his path. C then plays a one-two with D, timing a second movement to slide an angled pass for D''s give-and-go round his cone; D dribbles to the start.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '7-9 (2-4 extra)', 7, 9, '10 yard line / 12 yard triangle', 9.1, 11.0, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 620),
  ('Rhombus switches of play, find third man', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 133, 133, 'Heynckes Practice 1', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Support positioning, switching play and scanning for the third man in the rhombus.', '10 yard rhombus: A queue at the bottom, B right, C top, D left.', 'A passes to B, who has dropped, and steps forward for the return; B circles his cone, gets it back from A and switches across to D, who has come off his cone. C checks one way then spins the other round his cone to take D''s lay-off; D overlaps round his cone for C''s pass and then plays to B''s position. The next A continues, so the pattern flows B to A, A to B, B to D.', '1-2 touches', NULL, 'Check away before receiving, scan for the third man, support wide and forward.', '10-12 (2-4 extra)', 10, 12, '10 yard rhombus', 9.1, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 630),
  ('Two-ball double mirrored rhombus, drop and shift', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 134, 135, 'Heynckes Practice 2', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Support positioning, switching play and scanning for the third man with two balls at once.', 'Two 10 yard rhombuses mirrored around a shared middle: start queues A (bottom) and E (top), wide players B (right) and D (left), inner players C and F. Two balls run the same pattern at once.', 'A and E pass to B and D, who drop to receive. C and F drop and then curve across to take B''s and D''s passes. B and D move the opposite way to get the next pass from C and F, then play to the next players waiting at the starts.', '1-2 touches', 'Heynckes Practice 3 (p135, same set-up): C and F pass to B and D on the opposite side of their cone, so the ball is switched for a cutting run on the far side; B then plays back to E''s position and D back to A''s.', NULL, '10-12 (2-4 extra)', 10, 12, '2 x 10 yard rhombuses', 18.3, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 640),
  ('Two-ball double rhombus, open up, give-and-go', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 136, 136, 'Heynckes Practice 4', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Synchronised attacking combinations with counter-movements in a micro-game.', 'Two rhombus circuits side by side with 10 yard distances: start queues A and A1 at the bottom, B and B1 in the middle, C and C1 at the top, D and D1 out wide. Both sides run at once (mirrored).', 'A passes to B, who checks then counter-moves to receive, opens up and passes to C. C opens up with a directional touch round his cone, plays a one-two with D, then slides it into space for D, who first dropped and then counter-moved to receive; D dribbles to the A1 queue.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '14-16 (4-6 extra)', 14, 16, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 18.3, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 650),
  ('Two-ball double rhombus, one-twos, third man', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 137, 137, 'Heynckes Practice 5', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Synchronised attacking combinations and third man runs in a micro-game.', 'Two rhombus circuits side by side, 10 yard distances: queues A and A1 at the bottom, B and B1 in the middle, C and C1 at the top, D and D1 wide. Both sides run at once (mirrored).', 'A plays a one-two with B and runs on to the return, then passes to C. B makes a third man run to take C''s lay-off and C spins round his cone for B''s return. D, having dropped, counter-moves onto C''s through pass and dribbles to A1.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '14-16 (4-6 extra)', 14, 16, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 18.3, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 660),
  ('Two-ball double rhombus, forward runs, overlaps', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 138, 138, 'Heynckes Practice 6', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Synchronised attacking combinations with forward runs and overlaps.', 'Two rhombus circuits side by side, 10 yard distances: queues A and A1 at the bottom, B and B1 in the middle, C and C1 at the top, D and D1 wide. Both sides run at once (mirrored).', 'A passes to B, who checks and counter-moves to receive. B plays a one-two with C moving forward, then passes across to D, who lays it back for C running round his cone. D overlaps round his cone to receive C''s through pass and dribbles to the start.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '14-16 (4-6 extra)', 14, 16, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 18.3, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 670),
  ('Central rhombus open up, give-and-go overlap', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 139, 139, 'Heynckes Practice 7', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Synchronised combinations in the rhombus shape, finishing with an overlap.', 'Central 10 yard rhombus with A queue at the bottom, B left-centre, C right, C1 left, D top-centre; E and E1 at the top corners.', 'A passes to B, who moves off his cone and opens up to play C. C checks, moves and passes to D, who comes off his cone and plays E. E moves one way then plays a give-and-go with D, running round his cone for the return, and dribbles back to A. Repeat via C1 and E1.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '12-14 (4-6 extra)', 12, 14, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 680),
  ('Central rhombus double support, overlap', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 140, 140, 'Heynckes Practice 8', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Double support play in the rhombus with an overlapping give-and-go.', 'Central 10 yard rhombus with A queue at the bottom, B left-centre, C right, C1 left, D top-centre; E and E1 at the top corners.', 'A to B, who opens up and passes to C; C checks and plays D. D comes off his cone and sets it for C''s inside run, C finds E. D moves across and E plays a give-and-go with him, circling his cone, then dribbles to A. Repeat via C1 and E1.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '12-14 (4-6 extra)', 12, 14, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 690),
  ('Triple one-two, forward pass, overlap', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 141, 141, 'Heynckes Practice 9', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Chained one-twos and an opening-up forward pass ending in an overlap.', 'Central 10 yard rhombus with A queue at the bottom, B left-centre, C right, C1 left, D top-centre; E and E1 at the top corners.', 'A plays a one-two with B, then another with C, before passing forward to D who opens up and plays E. E moves one way then does a give-and-go with D round his cone and dribbles to A. Repeat via C1 and E1.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '12-14 (4-6 extra)', 12, 14, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 700),
  ('Different runs for lay-offs, overlap', 'passing_unopposed', 'unopposed', 'in_possession', 142, 142, 'Heynckes Practice 10', 'Heynckes (Bayern Munich)', 'Varied receiving runs off lay-offs and a closing give-and-go overlap.', 'Central 10 yard rhombus with A queue at the bottom, B left-centre, C right, C1 left, D top-centre; E and E1 at the top corners.', 'A plays one-twos with B and then C before passing forward to D, who lays it back for C running round his cone. C passes to E while D moves to meet the next ball; E plays a give-and-go with D, circling his cone, and dribbles to A. Repeat via C1 and E1.', '1-2 touches', NULL, NULL, '12-14 (4-6 extra)', 12, 14, '10 yard distances', 9.1, 9.1, NULL, false, false, false, NULL, 710)
) AS v(t, cat, opp, m, pf, pt, ref, coach, obj, setup, proc, rules, prog, cp, players, mn, mx, area, len, wid, dur, goals, gk, dir, age, so)
